# Rendered by scripts/render.py (make build) from src/: never hand-edit these,
# edit src/ and re-render. The rendered Markdown carries no inline marker, since
# every skill and agent file loads into the model's context when it runs (see
# CLAUDE.md, "One source, three renders"). linguist-generated also collapses
# them in GitHub diffs. Keep this list in step with MANAGED_DIRS in
# scripts/render.py; make test checks it. Not listed, because hand-written:
# jidoka/evals/, jidoka-cursor/.cursor-plugin/, jidoka-cursor/rules/,
# jidoka-cursor/README.md, jidoka-cursor/SMOKE-TEST.md, and
# .claude-plugin/marketplace.json (only two of its arrays are rendered).
jidoka/agents/** linguist-generated=true
jidoka/skills/** linguist-generated=true
jidoka/hooks/** linguist-generated=true
jidoka-copilot/** linguist-generated=true
jidoka-cursor/agents/** linguist-generated=true
jidoka-cursor/skills/** linguist-generated=true
jidoka-cursor/hooks/** linguist-generated=true
